l community of settlers. Welcome to Cattle Country!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818150/extras/7f67bff9b01fde48430b5b902ba9a1bb.poster.avif?t=1754390571\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818150/extras/7f67bff9b01fde48430b5b902ba9a1bb.webm?t=1754390571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818150/extras/7f67bff9b01fde48430b5b902ba9a1bb.mp4?t=1754390571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Howdy partner! Welcome to Cattle Country, the Cozy Cowboy Adventure Life Sim. Become a determined pioneer traveling west to start a new life. Make a home in the mountains, take on bandits, discover dastardly plots, build a farm, develop your town, and make friends with fellow residents.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese",
    "reviews": "\u201cCattle Country defies the odds and certainly manages to make its mark on the life sim genre. It\u2019s charming, fun, and packed with unexpected surprises and a thrilling sense of adventure that sets it apart from many of its competitors.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 GAMINGbible<br><br>\u201cCattle Country offers an unforgettable experience. In a market saturated with stimuli and speed, this game  invites you to stop, observe, and, above all, feel. And for that reason, despite its limitations and simplicity, it  deserves a special place in the heart of anyone who gives it a chance.\u201d<br>Combocaster<br><br>\u201cCattle Country combines the Wild West into a cozy farming game. It's an ambitious entry that contributes a  lot to its genre, while also taking inspiration from some of the best gameplay mechanics from its peers.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Game Luster<br>",
